license — see [`src/internal/standard14_outlines.fonts/OFL.txt`](src/internal/standard14_outlines.fonts/OFL.txt).
The MIT license above covers the library's own code (SPDX: `MIT AND OFL-1.1` for the distribution
as a whole).

